  "description": "Nurture (E9-T1): a programme runs a journey (a workflow definition) for an audience list at a cadence, with its optional parts (tracks, pause, recycling, SLA, content selection, agent suggestions) each off until switched on; tracks per lifecycle stage, interest and language; content per track (an email, article or event, in order). Leads and contacts gain lifecycle stage, nurture interest, recycle reason and wake-up date; a lead keeps the campaign it came from (D3-T1).",
